+/*
+ * CONTIG HINT SUPPORT TABLE
+ *
+ *------------------------------------------------------------------
+ *| Page Size | CONT PTE |  Block  | CONT Block | L1 Block | CONT L1 |
+ *------------------------------------------------------------------
+ *|     4K    |   64K    |   2M    |    32M     |    1G    |   16G   |
+ *|    16K    |    2M    |  32M    |     1G     |          |         |
